.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"485d747d2b678507ec5320035a61dc6608a5c874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commits/485d747d2b678507ec5320035a61dc6608a5c874","html_url":"https://github.com/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commit/485d747d2b678507ec5320035a61dc6608a5c874"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"94f3e9aa11bcdd13a2a579e1bbb6a3f57593ef8b","node_id":"C_kwDOU6_c0toAKDk0ZjNlOWFhMTFiY2RkMTNhMmE1NzllMWJiYjZhM2Y1NzU5M2VmOGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"jx1230","email":"321720396@qq.com","date":"2026-10-07T02:17:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"jx1230","email":"321720396@qq.com","date":"2026-10-07T02:17:25Z"},"message":"fix(docs+gate): 收口参数漂移与窃听口径，并补强第六道门\n\n**内容层（治标）**\n\n- 主文档 §10.18「当前状态」：原文写「当前默认 `stress_k = 0` 与 `deviance_k = 0`（只观测不生效）」，\n  但配置早已是 `stress_k = 0.40`（已开启）。改为**分别陈述两者现状**——`stress_k` 已开启、\n  `deviance_k = 0.0` 仍关闭（后者正是 §10.19 双稳态起不来的原因）；小节标题同步去掉\n  「压力效果待开启」这一失效表述。\n- 主文档 §10.28.3：该节的参数（`noise_base_fear` 1.3 / `stress_k` 0.20）与指标\n  （爆发 15.9 / 好感均值 58.8 / SD 22.5）属**较早一轮标定**，与 §3.4 的当前实测\n  （25.6 / 48.3 / 22.2）不是同一轮。按**「标为历史轮次」**处理（用户裁决 A）：\n  小标题改为「当时参数与实测（历史轮次，勿引用）」，加注说明当前取值与实测分别在哪，\n  并保留「减压侧先查哪里漏」这条与轮次无关、仍然有效的结论。\n  （不改成 2.8/0.40 的理由：那会造出「参数是新的、实测数据是旧轮次的」假对应。）\n- 主文档 §10.9 / §12.2：窃听口径收口。§18.9 已声明「不纳入任何版本实现」，\n  但 §10.9 标题与 §12.2「玩家可用行为」表仍把它当要做的东西——同一文档两处打架。\n  两处各加标注并互链 §18.9。\n- `data/rules/environment.csv`：`stress_k` 的注释写着「默认 0 = 只观测不生效」而值为 0.40，\n  **值与注释在同一个格子里自相矛盾**（违反 §3.4.1 纪律④）。改为与值一致。\n\n**门层（治本）**——`tools/check_docs.py` 项② 补强，根因是两处漏洞恰好一漏一放：\n\n- 漏洞①「必须有反引号」：§10.28.3 的 `noise_base_fear = 1.3  stress_k = 0.20`\n  一个反引号都没有 → **完全不扫，静默漏过**。现补一条仅在**代码块内**与**表格行内**\n  生效的无反引号匹配，避免误扫正文叙述。\n- 漏洞②「豁免词表太宽」：`当前默认 `stress_k = 0`` 明明匹配上了，却因同行有「默认」\n  而被当作历史语境放过——**而这行恰恰是错的**。已移除「默认」，并一并移除同样过宽的\n  「关闭」「= 0 =」，改为**窄的条件式豁免**（设 / 若 / 即关闭 / 可关闭）——\n  该豁免是实测加出来的：`设 `burst_p_max = 0` 即关闭概率爆发` 是条件式表述，非当前值断言。\n- 新增项②b：**`data/` 各表的 note 与 value 一致性**（注释里「默认 X」≠ 本行实测值即报），\n  即 §3.4.1 纪律④ 的自动化。这正是 `environment.csv` 那处漂移的直接防线——\n  数据表内的漂移此前**完全没有门覆盖**。\n\n**验证**\n\n- 两条新规则经**受控回退测试**确认能抓到对应的原始 bug（把两处临时还原 → 均报红 →\n  还原后复绿）。这一步是必需的：该门历史上出现过「匹配不上却报绿」的**假的绿**先例，\n  只看「现在是绿的」不足以证明规则有效。\n- 六道门复跑全绿：`check_config` 176 / `test_core` 30 / `verify_formula` 11 /\n  `check_metrics` 分布判据 / `diversity_report` 存在性与多样性 / `check_docs` 0 失败。","tree":{"sha":"ef5b2bc1656792e7290be8515e83e5fc5d0c0ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/git/trees/ef5b2bc1656792e7290be8515e83e5fc5d0c0ad5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/git/commits/94f3e9aa11bcdd13a2a579e1bbb6a3f57593ef8b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commits/94f3e9aa11bcdd13a2a579e1bbb6a3f57593ef8b","html_url":"https://github.com/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commit/94f3e9aa11bcdd13a2a579e1bbb6a3f57593ef8b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commits/94f3e9aa11bcdd13a2a579e1bbb6a3f57593ef8b/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"87091ee0b50473ed87cec0d9111abd60a57b3bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commits/87091ee0b50473ed87cec0d9111abd60a57b3bfa","html_url":"https://github.com/jx321720396/Ten-minutes-after-class/commit/87091ee0b50473ed87cec0d9111abd60a57b3bfa"}]},"status":"behind","ahead_by":0,"behind_by":6,"total_commits":0,"commits":[],"files":[]}